## HR-01 — /api/auth/desktop-callback/:provider has no rate-limit

Disposition: **STILL LIVE.**
Evidence: `grep -n "rateLimit" apps/api/src/routes/auth-callback.ts` → NO match.
Route registered at `auth-callback.ts:124` with `{ config: { auth: false } }`
only — no `rateLimit` key. Falls to the plugin global default + the
always-on 600/min GLOBAL_IP_CEILING. LOCKER-04 obligation unmet (real
budget, not `rateLimit:false`).
Fix: add `rateLimit: { max: 60, timeWindow: "1 minute" }` (sibling
public-auth-flow cluster value — auth-providers.ts, locale.ts).

